    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jonny Everhart, a man with a troubled past, takes a job as a night security guard at an isolated forest park. The site, once a haven for visitors, hides dark secrets left by its blood-stained history. However, as Jonny begins his rounds, he realizes something is wrong. Strange sounds echo through the trees, shadows move where they shouldn't, and an invisible presence seems to watch you at every step. Between unfinished reports from former employees and distorted radio recordings, Jonny discovers that the forest isn't just haunted... it wants something from him. Now, trapped in a nightmare where reality falls apart, Jonny must fight to survive while trying to unravel the park's mysteries. But the real question is: does he really want to know the truth?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jonny Everhart, a man with a troubled past, takes a job as a night security guard at an isolated forest park. The site, once a haven for visitors, hides dark secrets left by its blood-stained history. However, as Jonny begins his rounds, he realizes something is wrong. Strange sounds echo through the trees, shadows move where they shouldn't, and an invisible presence seems to watch you at every step. Between unfinished reports from former employees and distorted radio recordings, Jonny discovers that the forest isn't just haunted... it wants something from him. Now, trapped in a nightmare where reality falls apart, Jonny must fight to survive while trying to unravel the park's mysteries. But the real question is: does he really want to know the truth?</p>",
